      "id": "yeats-collected-poems-s0262-p00540",
      "source_en": "The chambermaid lived long, and took\nTheir graves into her charge,\nAnd there two bushes planted\nThat when they had grown large 6o\nSeemed sprung from but a single root\nSo did their roses merge.\n 0 my dear, 0 my dear.",
